## Engagement vs. Understanding: Comparing Immersive Virtual Reality and Desktop Displays for Climate Data Visualization
* VR vs. Desktop: same forgetting, desktops better for cognitive learning, VR better for affective learning for short term - but fades within 2 weeks
* desktop systematic, VR fragmented -- scaffold structural explorations; reinforce learned aspect